    "created_at": "2017-10-11T19:40:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-11T19:40:34Z",
    "body": "This makes sense as part of the permissions API. Given that some permissions, like USB, are prominently displayed because of the security concerns it makes sense that a site may want the ability to self-revoke them when they are no longer required. This is also similar to the Feature Policy work.",
